 to teaching\n\n3. **Epilepsy Resources**:\n   - Referral to comprehensive epilepsy center/epileptologist for ongoing management\n   - Epilepsy Foundation resources: seizure action plans, support groups, legal advocacy for employment protection\n   - Medical alert bracelet recommendation\n\n4. **Childcare & Family Support**:\n   - Brain Injury Association of America (BIAA) local chapter for family resources\n   - Identify emergency childcare plan in the event of a seizure while caring for children\n   - Safety-proof the home: no unsupervised bathing, avoid cooking on open flame when alone with children, install child safety locks',
